{
  "locale": "en",
  "family": "relationship",
  "templates": [
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary-missed.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} forgot the anniversary with {other}.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:981e45603311bd556bf2a17d5e6fe16f2433ddd6f31f7bd8e760dff7763558fd"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary-missed.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor:possessiveCapitalized} schedule had everything on it except the anniversary with {other}.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e6631304faf2d5c9db729ebb4d77c016174809c3efed0c9b15c87edb0da51dd0"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary-missed.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{other} waited all evening; {actor}, down in the mines, noticed nothing.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d65e03a83224639662893e390b572a914ec3c4e296bf0332ec1d221e73002dce"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary-missed.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Busy days blur together, and {actor} let the most important one slip.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8cc21febb7911915a578ea7efd6fce9fd7aa6982361aa6b1b199fe3cac583699"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary-missed.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} remembered the anniversary only near the end of the day and could no longer pretend nothing was wrong in front of {other}.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:38801c22a42dd0864fe8059fed12b96d36e0be1a9519b5c8afbcaa8f9fac6133"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary-missed.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{other} waited all day without any acknowledgment before {actor} finally realized what had been missed.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:10f82d03dcb55206b964329544844b6becfec6f0778148f293ea6b0e8185fc87"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary-missed.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} remembered the ordinary schedule perfectly but forgot the important day shared with {other}.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:04d8d6eb35a7cd32eb49a16a7c992fae9b05f3ea8605c3e720de6546ead1e45a"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary-missed.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "By the time {actor} offered belated wishes, {other} was no longer in the mood to celebrate.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:eb964f7ce7428e20b8ca798cbb9752c5efc55aa374ca5c22a02fb3835489a859"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary-missed.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} tried to make up for it with a late anniversary greeting, and {other} only looked back in silence.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a07c3fee040595dc304283623b3178a5da5e22578f8b70b7beadc4d0f7071210"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary-missed.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Only after seeing {other} put away a prepared gesture alone did {actor} understand that the anniversary had been missed.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:fd614fd7c4a8d8652b4327ef40b5072dc23e5b1fd6f22a3401dca73af4372f79"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} marked the day they got together.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9b9cb3d89c53f130dfcf6fbe4598cf4351cb8e6019801014d202290ef15585c9"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} made it through another year together — worth a toast.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2b3a831b6bfe2f33f70e366bab80dc849aa5d0ce3eab8fd020363a8e01663a3b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "In a place where you keep the calendar yourself, {a} and {b} remembered the day.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:07570cdd4bc830993f19df4ad4ef8c7abada4453e1ba482a5c7c598b64d74c7d"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} celebrated like it was a colony-wide holiday — as far as they were concerned, it was.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:20155c1311246b6a3562fad30965f5fd9501b583652e1d4c41a501942b118a8e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} remembered the day they first came together and raised a cup to another anniversary.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3fa201b67c59bced6f3d3397dfa536f3d42a86215cb2dfdc5beebb59a1181529"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} set work aside for a while and deliberately made time to celebrate each other.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:1a06f1b06ab9131981ff0d5c0c11621b1a4b7adfda6d0d301a767464abe95437"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} exchanged small prepared gestures, neither having forgotten the day.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6070b718d7688f268cb19fef4233ae5c890d1993f0035ce29d74dc886340fa8d"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} counted the cycles they had shared and found many moments worth remembering.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6134044f6dcab5d551e169ea22d84c27517844ec1d5dd59601c526d8c399daae"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} planned no grand celebration and simply kept the day for each other.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a20480605455046448ceef90b5c7fa3a36d67751ee17078b999d1b18b6e3bba2"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.anniversary.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "On their anniversary, {a} and {b} repeated their original promise with greater certainty.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8ee9f1ca2dad643e54faf3ed86278e0d438545686daa0f956c21d68eff29271d"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology-bond.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "A conflict, of all things, made {a} and {b} good friends.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9701e5e0221f817d65f2d17f93dd0113435bbb13fb1ad080844e38c7ae497166"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology-bond.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} talked it all out and came out of it friends.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:223c3bbe7d5acf4fa16d46ad22c6fbc99f1cc633a9084730cd22e2f6574283bc"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology-bond.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After the apology, {a} and {b} were closer than before the fight.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:050a312afdd067d166fb272beb99ed6b661a07abba7aae9b4883b0e68793ad6c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology-bond.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} had a fight, then became friends. That's just how it went.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f907ac64bbd40ee75714d46f129ba5e2902a92fe8fca20f7f3a85ffe2257fdba"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology-bond.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} talked through the conflict from the beginning and found that both were willing to yield for the relationship.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3aaf4cf11b630390da011729294b80ff149640b80652270d3368fcf751e88533"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology-bond.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} did not avoid the uncomfortable parts, and the honesty deepened their trust.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9cf6163fce9586d35905bda5099297e59ac360b43c682693dc7285615694cf54"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology-bond.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} admitted their own mistakes, turning an apology into a new understanding.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:85c66b32b8b96b5a4a32c553e210e6fa3718e3b5971b2ae89a3bbb84e1aea8fa"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology-bond.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} only meant to end the dispute, but came away truly understanding each other for the first time.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e78a94e2c92bacea6a976ed5d85a820b68611df0d675972bae1ee947a956dcfb"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology-bond.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After making peace, {a} and {b} stayed together and voiced things they had not dared to say before.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a401adb1c0d2afa873c03599e57f89af431b321799be67c1b3d90887e18a3ea6"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology-bond.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Through the conflict, {a} and {b} saw that the other was still willing to stay, leaving the bond stronger than before.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e317a67127cb63c6ba6f2c97d9e4e09ff9a29d088d4d057e338e3215388c7072"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} apologized to {other}.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:78948861d6713bbf440736cdbe8ccc5e5db103068a11acb892fb0682cae73bf7"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} yielded first, and {other} forgave.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:929579576ee93cf6765b7c47bbb967c676a4cdc44f72d72d59dc64e6af19226e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} stumbled through the word \"sorry\"; {other} accepted it.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ab8bef16601285431b8de3ef20d53aa5d082608b32fce5bb56d9e16900182da6"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} offered a mush bar by way of apology.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a36b07b5a520e6c059f1a4b79e5794740f1ea5b21a970f227e78520952bdf6e8"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Between pride and {other}, {actor} chose {other}.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c33f8d2b5392eac1c8115e59671c07b1001d881c7da351f300826fe37bed47ca"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} made no excuses and plainly told {other} what had been done wrong.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0d44a894208fa3b394ee42ee8903a147d8a93d891c59fdd91de5db5422916106"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} waited until {other} had expressed every grievance before sincerely asking forgiveness.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ffe345e321429667ce1c34cd5b01e1d7827c2041b40f0b981f6ad541b2c81508"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} admitted that the words had caused harm and promised {other} a different approach next time.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:11de19b67751e6f6a3e874da9fc5d308ce43b62f4325a4f23153fb0a41c54178"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} delivered the apology slowly, making sure {other} heard sincerity rather than obligation.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0857d0f84e65f2c0ef7a923ceb4ce0d1c87b9d1708208432cac593f873d710d1"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.apology.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} sought {other} out and admitted fault instead of waiting for time to blur the issue.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a1a8421c0b7c6c916e0a80e6d2e138716796605c00e558b04d65eb1c7370421c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} and {other} had an argument.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b9dd371f4d8deb25ae1fbe45ddae0514386d329f2ef3e8dec9a1776d4069ab98"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} and {other} quarreled, neither willing to back down.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9567a190ae6f50b0ff4dcab7fd7f4167113623a82a3e6ae86af6bf0a3f833648"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} and {other:possessive} voices rose high enough to startle the hatches next door.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:57abcd10775b2a6def3e1eff9611363befa9251066e69c2bf1a16a1531ec693f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} and {other} got heated over something trivial; in hindsight, neither could say what.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0d967716fb10130aef028d7dc36d7ae7ef380e81acced07c7649a10818a19585"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When the shouting was over, {actor} and {other} each blamed the other for starting it.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a19ca8d422bc77cef5f1f1b04079c44ccbf14041de2f0ea79e82eec0e780a4b4"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} raised the voice first, and when {other} refused to yield, the dispute quickly sharpened.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:802759a25f2741e8201f6f8038081559442a7a0808de9a5e927884b749a43630"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} accused {other} of not listening, and the two immediately began to argue.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5a0c1829ec6abd704c121190653e830086215ba6ed5b911f8f799dd0db4b8f6b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} released every accumulated grievance, and {other} answered each one in turn.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a815856a2cb8c8c56a88c89117df102cd0badfb88efc16e5923d7b83ef6b9c9a"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} tried to force an admission from {other}, but both ended up hearing only their own anger.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:fcc62a080af983530643f420a7ce524cb5e0f083977a01eaa719ce6a6745d8ae"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "A harsh remark from {actor} crossed the line, and {other} no longer tried to remain calm.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d7ee373903ba4776f2296f141561d41d109c7751304adc6e6c74d73df0f1ed1f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.with-cause.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Over {cause}, {actor} and {other} got into an argument.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:fe22db3ec1b0243a6e26745578c8224614314c7a3b20dc58a1d46722ab71aeb0"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.with-cause.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Because of {cause}, {actor} confronted {other}, and the exchange quickly became an argument.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e242b5088bea55aca03bce5d98003eeab1c25c27fa760ff2392a39ea582bfc8f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.with-cause.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} blamed {other} for the frustration over {cause}, and {other} immediately pushed back.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5eb783ea4cf54fd39984270785bc4afa10d47185b2a5d431a3f49315d4cb20e1"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.with-cause.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Over {cause}, {actor} and {other} held opposing positions, and neither persuaded the other.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8c581d3db4c7ce0abd47730d5bbf38485a32cc06ae09b3cbd9c9b250cc79e713"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.with-cause.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} demanded an explanation from {other} about {cause}, and the answer only increased the anger.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0219066f79cb6aa27a5da8523bf96483b4c2cb3b35a826aa7095314cb43e575c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.with-cause.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{cause} became the spark: {actor} attacked first, and {other} brought up old grievances in return.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:355727c3c0783ebaead99bba24deb9195f5dc26514baf0feb00cfea18875a255"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.with-cause.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} decided that {other} was responsible for {cause}, and the two argued bitterly over it.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:69ab75cf19e201943416466232a68a78c5e8e371118526d61295aaba1abed3b9"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.with-cause.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "When {cause} came up, {actor} lost patience and {other} refused to keep yielding.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e989fc6d3a4f22261f2b6e01b8e610b00ddae74416339f8aa2edb72799bf3d93"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.with-cause.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} meant to clarify {cause} with {other}, but emotion turned the explanation into accusation.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f500ed6272ec96e67d8d50d70b115ec61aba5a77cd134e9eb6b7345a6995523a"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.argument.with-cause.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Both {actor} and {other} felt wronged over {cause}, pulling the argument deeper.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:402f840a4d6c67c7126e3dd5be9c9a6330240a578c2c3785be7a4b0f6cd5b4c3"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.breakup.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} and {other} broke up.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6cb275432926cbc18b2b8f09be9a5b27dca58c8681d33d3c3ba83fa9af07dbe8"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.breakup.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} and {other:possessive} relationship reached its end.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:086fec1803714f3d6018d68943409673f8356c5fb93f2ec9e3e9f266c316ecdd"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.breakup.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} and {other} said what needed saying, then turned and walked away.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:4cc33c45e20bad52d98a7ab23d0a1e82accf7009105e408ebed79439aa0c0a0e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.breakup.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} and {other:possessive} relationship ran out like an atmo suit's oxygen.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:aa12df949157b70a858b8a8e8bd5097d8db8da857b7e6d2bae6c2a1bfb992d54"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.breakup.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{other} wanted to try again; {actor} was done talking.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d0ac1e6b05bde2974198025c33fdabf3e3b971a11df63ca262fbe1843d20f6a5"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.breakup.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} told {other} that the relationship could not continue and ended their partnership.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f3c4d27c307fad587795e0460755add9fd08994abbac58ecc781e6e6a582036e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.breakup.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After {actor} said the words of separation, {other} remained silent for a long time before accepting them.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8f386a600455204f4a4ae3a036a3b2b5015e85128dc868571b686267ddc90686"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.breakup.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} admitted being unable to face {other} as before, and the two separated.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b203795a57fc9ee8462d1aceeb3d86016b66476cefa7a06ad0072b5d3001618f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.breakup.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} left no ambiguity and clearly told {other} that the relationship was over.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6c9235a9309222ade02bd54d3015da25c99d49d2d6087adcc220233047cf1131"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.breakup.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} and {other} had one final talk and decided not to continue as partners.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:50c4c8cea8e3e96ca89b6a23a181da5ea9ad947d2662f8eb0a7629830e1002cf"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession-fail.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} confessed to {other}, but {other} did not say yes.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a321b7dc9eb009827af1c412155e40dd9c5776b45466afb6b4aa63fbc7539d46"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession-fail.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{other} could not return {actor:possessive} feelings.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6a3e53d9f2386885fe54dd46520cd92a3d31c12dabe3d0687efbda396c9123e9"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession-fail.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} delivered the rehearsed confession; {other} stayed silent for a long while.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:459acff017350b23687573edc91fe2450375a05f7605890230fa0f49c77d5d89"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession-fail.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Not every heartfelt word finds an echo; {actor} learned that today.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f14c6a0f11dbbb912a6f7ccac558d711ca33157a9ccda57d18811101ef44873a"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession-fail.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After {actor} finished confessing, a long wait ended with {other} shaking the head.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2abd32feb1002cce10dc695ddac9ee764132358fea1bf610c5f3631cad9d49e8"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession-fail.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{other} listened carefully to {actor:possessive} confession but could not return the same feeling.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:16a999f765e4b210494a017b805308a57424003b0d3c7b2954f1e81a7f2b95d9"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession-fail.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} tried to hide the disappointment and still thanked {other} for an honest answer.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:eabd972e9ab49e847e85ae1f6bd6bb7d6cb18a07fe6793a65d8fc5d982d23b5f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession-fail.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The courage {actor} gathered did not bring the hoped-for result, leaving {actor} to accept {other:possessive} refusal.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:aca767f0bc607ec136cada3a1607a1241464f119b256b83181364eaf74e212ec"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession-fail.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{other} refused {actor} gently but clearly, leaving no hope that could be misunderstood.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:827be44e8661ad8b52630ffe03db04fb394cf02f2bf401a62bd631e88155d6fe"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession-fail.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} had prepared many words, but after hearing {other:possessive} answer could only say, \"I understand.\"",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c22b4092dac39b8e15aa3292435406b395d620b15787802fe4ebce11c097f371"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} confessed their feelings to {other} — {other} said yes.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:1309d83d5b8fb845c8948926d699551a6f6471d4240c58fa9261e405d5c8632f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} found the courage to confess; {other}, blushing, nodded.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:1aae2aae912690e982208b5cba69f075d490b7a79005681fa50e4c9fdbffabb5"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} got halfway through the rehearsed speech before {other} said yes.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:4a6bb972d09d711647431b8fa91b1c51b356d150a88cb0cffbf9019b1e8ef1c0"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "With the printing pod as their witness, {actor} took {other:possessive} hand.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3707eeba4d87be92e1b2212277355a17679dd9757029482ce6e02bc92e44553e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{other} had waited a long time for those words; {actor} finally said them.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f98e18617f151d82425d1afa4ebb6af9a659760bfe787fcc6b602672decc9900"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} told {other} the feelings that had been hidden for a long time and received an affirmative answer.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:99959bec3c0d7108b3fea8a33a0cf40033e8dc256eed28cd03a529ff7911ef68"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} admitted wanting a future with {other}, and {other} answered with a sincere yes.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:54429b8e5f712d4c970f3b412dc3cf9bc9f0407237d76699d11e42cf27ed42f3"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Near the end, {actor} became too nervous to continue, and {other} reached out to take the offered hand.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:bbc3c31ff863a8e7182ffde2d7c49e5328cd6a2ee4d3a937c425a8a8e5a60718"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} had prepared no elegant speech, only an honest declaration of affection that {other} returned.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9fc1d69347bb2b4555897fbb8e2ebe976bc2573a35e8f544b5c47b4471c7838c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.confession.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} asked whether {other} would become a partner, and the answer left both smiling.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:960ed89a3b52c6b13b81c0dcd083bad68acfdadfcb2465fc5fdb1150d55d8fc3"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.date.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} went on a date; the mood was just right.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d2de6933c99c55bdbe995f75529d312fabfebe5f8a1c2f6d0ff2dc040908827c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.date.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} stole a moment alone, with eyes only for each other.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c91662808dc278e4be526e3cdc8e3b9e48d54f6ce48c57bc605f9ea4473748a5"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.date.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} walked side by side; neither mentioned going back to work.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:dda377fafe7108a620cd4a0dc1e2e322791b4405c8c1fa798acf67717dabc1a4"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.date.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} had their date by the telescope, taking turns at the same patch of stars.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a2a4e177f426873a24a0d2a8c76c45fd6f6411202f779a1a8c7ac2dd1557f277"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.date.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} set one rule for the date: no talk of work schedules.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c55a42e3b2185f1988961a5ae08d5e7dbe9038fbd7dc51a934d3664f8c2dc0f7"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.date.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} kept a stretch of free time for each other and enjoyed a quiet date.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c915b1a6d93287b5a9d5363e2b594c14979b7def986ce88248894a8716ffad5b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.date.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} left work unmentioned and asked about what each truly cared about lately.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:547efc77e4a2f1936aff54b401af88f285e48df428a1ee6b6df3720c1e2de618"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.date.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} stayed side by side for a long while, neither rushing toward the next task.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:fec43e0a53ee83ea42908cf8eaa62d6e40fb46d6d0b8c10bf818508f58895ebb"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.date.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} prepared carefully for the date, and each noticed the other's effort on meeting.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9aae67a3e9e56a598595d8c8f2de802fb7ca6c1eb509ab8b36f753a0887ddcc4"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.date.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} revisited the details that first drew them together, softening the mood between them.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:48a58db6a1329eb26973a90fef660104d5f97faf6d5164b1b065123fb8b306d7"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.fallout.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} had a bitter fight and became strangers.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ff2ec2329d7ca1b37400b0e1d05927e303c0d977d9a4cc6ddd4eeb9b63d0072e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.fallout.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Whatever warmth {a} and {b} had left was gone overnight.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e2ba5cd6129211d7eb74d6e990a50b65825a7b7cb9aecc0f7ebc269197119133"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.fallout.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Since that day, {a} and {b} take detours to avoid each other in the corridors.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:db1a157aff5c218582ac9c84aad9f8ab0894e50d26257f165c31933b76da02e8"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.fallout.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The friendship ran its course; {a} and {b} don't even nod anymore.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6db590aa0b12a25e4a273c11cd9a3bb29dfa980117fb939e7da1d9b8b828ba29"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.fallout.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} said the most hurtful things they could, breaking the trust that had remained.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:1f1c7d41611c3b0042566e29b53d71f0ec5054743a22bd6d688ef9871aa0c81e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.fallout.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Neither {a} nor {b} withdrew an accusation, leaving only estrangement when the dispute ended.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:aec1c27ba2f0135d5a73368bd26a8434a8681d9e7469b5be7d64dcc451794343"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.fallout.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The conflict between {a} and {b} crossed the line of easy repair, and the relationship fractured.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:785a5e47ac82581bc6edcc7d8bc8b94e6d94a5249e8cc7cbacbea3dc1b0cc74d"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.fallout.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} no longer trusted each other's explanations and began deliberately avoiding one another.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b3bfdf11ecf4378d1a2c35a9e61e66e0f120717a2444708a6f87c5701fa2c55e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.fallout.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "In anger, {a} and {b} rejected their former bond and did not reconnect after calming down.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0aba0e2712b28163a4212496f883811556e5df8e140d8047458895361029cc35"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.fallout.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} ended the argument without peace, leaving each other outside the relationship.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6e5473742348f1dea7b438d576b6ebe3415677a1cffd16b82a4296e38327ad07"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} was jealous.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:78e4be75cc745478fd29b317550861a1867882c9342206582c9fb1f20101f21e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The sour feeling crept up on {actor}, who couldn't say where it came from.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d98bd21f96df510f4035e4e4f68a3d40d78e627255986721ca0c0c031d1936b9"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} realized how much it mattered where the other person's attention went, and the jealousy could no longer be hidden.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:29ce8dcecbc68e92f93ec81dad9a020979dfdb607c8d2a0dc4a5b7a89ca14866"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} tried to appear indifferent, but irritation in the voice revealed the truth.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:eef15a9cd2cdaaf63d153a6d0e75f07e6456320e95afbe0933ef823f7fe79066"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Seeing a close person's attention turn elsewhere, {actor} grew steadily jealous in silence.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f190d0867188d9f0b63787e192669f932f50e9328a9f4177713e4554c8b837cb"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} repeatedly insisted there was no reason to care, but the feeling did not disappear.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e13c43c14688673e1d0bf8052461663e027ec8f80833861880e3ad126b6eabb1"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} made no scene, carrying the sting of jealousy into the time afterward.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:35118df4bbac9e82ba0aff45be0719256eceb428d86c2c10ce3cc3ec7374c2e5"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} abruptly became unusually quiet, with distance entering even ordinary replies.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a9433546a4ed37a3d0c65af4953eff6c30465bc87a3499f94b01378a307eb1e5"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} recognized a rising possessiveness but did not yet know how to explain it.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d8b4224d858b503d57a66063b7225598e0450dc0228b61d8645dcf3f8c81f3bb"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Disappointment at not receiving the expected attention quickly turned into jealousy for {actor}.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5ad941845e871329d67e8518c6b0c74e1577b33580dd15b4c4f2fc17c516e6ee"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.with-third.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} watched {other} laughing with {third}, and it stung.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8b6c4ab2cc2cdfad97240210c7f721ade23906da3af9e589942c400086316f2c"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.with-third.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{third} and {other} were deep in conversation; {actor} stood nearby, counting regolith.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ebe8decabae80ca983eb96d986adfdabfec0bcbe80cfe8fff8b46fcba006712a"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.with-third.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} watched {other} devote all attention to {third}, with displeasure becoming increasingly visible.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3e9cd929600a2f09c045f9f9f45b953110c3652ad3dd383aea56dd458d74b56b"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.with-third.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "As {third} and {other} became absorbed in conversation, {actor} repeatedly considered interrupting and stopped.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9f700e61a478451f27181c4e1f75fe2b218e777048cb32fac892add1926b1053"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.with-third.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} watched every response {other} gave {third} and found it increasingly difficult to stay calm.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:78f1e4ea69119937156d8a5f049820243944da081de9bbd9b7f9b795add1728e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.with-third.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{other} did not notice {actor:possessive} silence and continued the close conversation with {third}.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:09fe6fb8af7bb0f8ed798976eee46cb0f08b0c67523bef07bb67e29a593eae31"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.with-third.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} tried to believe that {other} and {third} were only interacting normally, but the jealousy remained.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:714ce1dd4c0d31a9df08cd44ce198318cf7c3083dd62e9e9b8cf92433d3b26e7"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.with-third.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "After {third} left, {actor} still faced {other} with unspoken resentment.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d0ce02e8ea352268e58399b6f37bf1c0d752583494ba761d08a05c132fb5f9be"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.with-third.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Seeing {other} smile because of {third}, {actor} suddenly felt left outside.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b564750abd709668a1a732c8d03d8f86141a6b81236876441e29adf870b577ef"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.jealousy.with-third.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{actor} did not blame {third}, but could not ignore seeing {other} offer closeness to someone else.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:78154adcff4affd1302cc46431b0b0c2b5887819ea2636dad28ef072e9679473"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.reconcile.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} let go of old grievances and made up.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5a3846dea01d731e0eb4aa8586af61f2e5ff5eae6fccfc03a0f7cdeb7383a10e"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.reconcile.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} closed the old ledger and sat down at the same table again.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:725b5c49df2737f2e3bdd54cbdb7025f4ec92786bf667da7d6de95f0c642b9ba"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.reconcile.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Whoever spoke first no longer matters; {a} and {b} made up.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f2d993d00e3c5495de6ef00395da66cdc82711dae66813df5e67aa98f0593b6f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.reconcile.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "The day the cold war ended, {a} and {b} both breathed easier.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3a16d14c853a047d2b4b40a06dee5bfd36afe4b2f8a6f9b66be8a37ba7a71b7f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.reconcile.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} finally sat down and heard each other out, beginning to loosen the cold war.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e37220b54c96dac707d72b84d21dbed25789be5622f5fec3b539b7af9253c278"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.reconcile.baseline.006",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} admitted that the standoff only caused more pain and chose to cooperate again.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:1d1390aafc496586accd445aad5fe31b12f9296761ba2981d5cd737071f26a44"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.reconcile.baseline.007",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} addressed every point of hurt instead of using silence as punishment.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:fc3f0c6d1d5d1ec9b4ddb445c280fbd774a22c7121ff8d6e1f650028bcf69e55"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.reconcile.baseline.008",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} tried beginning again with an ordinary greeting, giving the relationship room to warm.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7747328a85684ee4d74ede29a8c537a3dc27140c1bd5797060bca02a3fdb2669"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.reconcile.baseline.009",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Both {a} and {b} yielded a little, finally giving the long-stuck conflict a way out.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:30b01d87525754a2e2050a9feafd0b83eb87324ae7dc9de952f56904fc51eb71"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.reconcile.baseline.010",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} did not pretend the dispute had never happened; they decided not to let it govern what came next.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d15794bddf788ac47b92e2a508d147f782670e7995898efa8b96db99a31efeb6"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.rekindle.baseline.001",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} found their way back to each other.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e7118498bb21f7f72e7bef7ada36bc1e54aafa35b65d4dc5c93d453c9a43c362"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.rekindle.baseline.002",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} took the long way around and ended up back together.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6562b16d7d6aa16e030e55a1a1f989660a3855a12b03274db517a8bb2b106dbf"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.rekindle.baseline.003",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "Some partings are just for thinking things through. {a} and {b} thought it through.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:44a8edeb303a8afed13293d0d1d3927027f7e67cc0f38b8afcda9e772980d178"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.rekindle.baseline.004",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "text": "{a} and {b} held hands again, tighter than the first time.",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:cbeb88494e3202bdce4ed549b77fa53b15be5281e9bd712fe81435322960b27f"
    },
    {
      "templateId": "chronicle.rekindle.baseline.005",
      "status": "reviewed",
